erlink\" href=\"#text-banner-tab\" title=\"Permanent link\">&para;</a>"]},{"s":36319,"e":36393,"k":"block","t":"StyleKTPH000","f":["<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#style\" title=\"Permanent link\">&para;</a>"]},{"s":36402,"e":36861,"k":"block","t":"Choose a FIGlet font style from the dropdown. KTPH000StandardKTPH001 and KTPH002SlantKTPH003 come from the jfiglet library; KTPH0043-DKTPH005, KTPH006bannerKTPH007, KTPH008bigKTPH009, KTPH010blockKTPH011, KTPH012cosmicKTPH013, KTPH014DigitalKTPH015, KTPH016LeanKTPH017, KTPH018romanKTPH019, KTPH020scriptKTPH021 and KTPH022smallKTPH023 are bundled FIGfonts. A style whose font file cannot be loaded is left out of the list.","f":["<strong>","</strong>","<strong>","</strong>","<strong>","</strong>","<strong>","</strong>","<strong>","</strong>","<strong>","</strong>","<strong>","</strong>","<strong>","</strong>","<strong>","</strong>","<strong>","</strong>","<strong>","</strong>","<strong>","</strong>"]},{"s":36869,"e":37261,"k":"block","t":"Switch between styles with the dropdown, with the arrow keys (KTPH004KTPH000KTPH005, KTPH006KTPH001KTPH007, KTPH008KTPH002KTPH009, KTPH010KTPH003KTPH011) while the dropdown has focus, or with the ◀ and ▶ buttons beside it.","f":["<kbd class=\"key-arrow-left\">Left</kbd>","<kbd class=\"key-arrow-right\">Right</kbd>","<kbd class=\"key-arrow-up\">Up</kbd>","<kbd class=\"key-arrow-down\">Down</kbd>","<span class=\"keys\">","</span>","<span class=\"keys\">","</span>","<span class=\"keys\">","</span>","<span class=\"keys\">","</span>"]},{"s":37280,"e":37352,"k":"block","t":"TextKTPH000","f":["<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#text\" title=\"Permanent link\">&para;</a>"]},{"s":37361,"e":37527,"k":"block","t":"Type or paste the text to convert into the KTPH000TextKTPH001 field. Multi-line input is supported — each line is converted on its own, and blank lines stay blank.","f":["<strong>","</strong>"]},{"s":37535,"e":37621,"k":"block","t":"The KTPH000PreviewKTPH001 re-renders as you type and whenever you change the style.","f":["<strong>","</strong>"]},{"s":37650,"e":37742,"k":"block","t":"AI Picture tabKTPH000","f":["<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#ai-picture-tab\" title=\"Permanent link\">&para;</a>"]},{"s":37751,"e":37828,"k":"block","t":"Instead of lettering, this tab asks a model to draw the subject as a picture.","f":[]},{"s":37858,"e":37865,"k":"block","t":"Control","f":[]},{"s":37875,"e":37887,"k":"block","t":"What it does","f":[]},{"s":37925,"e":37949,"k":"block","t":"KTPH000SubjectKTPH001","f":["<strong>","</strong>"]},{"s":37959,"e":38102,"k":"block","t":"The thing to draw, for example KTPH000. Pressing KTPH002KTPH001KTPH003 starts the generation.","f":["<code>house</code>","<kbd class=\"key-enter\">Enter</kbd>","<span class=\"keys\">","</span>"]},{"s":38123,"e":38148,"k":"block","t":"KTPH000GenerateKTPH001","f":["<strong>","</strong>"]},{"s":38158,"e":38193,"k":"block","t":"Requests a picture for the subject.","f":[]},{"s":38214,"e":38241,"k":"block","t":"KTPH000AI profileKTPH001","f":["<strong>","</strong>"]},{"s":38251,"e":38348,"k":"block","t":"Which profile handles this run. The choice is transient and does not change your default profile.","f":[]},{"s":38369,"e":38399,"k":"block","t":"KTPH000New variationKTPH001","f":["<strong>","</strong>"]},{"s":38409,"e":38589,"k":"block","t":"Redraws the same subject with a different treatment — viewing angle, level of detail, line style, scene context or proportions — asking for something different again on each retry.","f":[]},{"s":38622,"e":38849,"k":"block","t":"The tab needs at least one configured AI profile and the AI features switch enabled; otherwise its controls stay disabled and the status line says so. Errors and \"no usable picture\" replies are reported in the same status line.","f":[]},{"s":38912,"e":38916,"k":"block","t":"Note","f":[]},{"s":38924,"e":39261,"k":"block","t":"The model is asked for printable ASCII only, at most 60 characters per line and 30 lines tall, so a result stays readable